('archive/7641275591798295828/','{"editions":{"ar":{"title":"هنقضيها بديهيات","description":"التحرش مش بس في الشارع ولا في السوشيال ميديا.","seoTitle":"هنقضيها بديهيات | من غير إذن","seoDescription":"التحرش مش بس في الشارع ولا في السوشيال ميديا.","body":"<section class=\"post-reading\"><h2>من نص السلايدز</h2><p dir=\"auto\">التحرش مش بس في الشارع ولا في السوشيال ميديا.</p><p dir=\"auto\">لو أخوكي أو أبوكي بيلمسك بشكل مش عاجبك يبقى متحرش. لو بتمثلي والممثل اللي قدامك تعدّى السيناريو في مشهد، ده اسمه تحرش.</p><p dir=\"auto\">تندر وبامبل وأي أبلكيشن ديتنج ممكن يكون فيه تحرش.</p></section>\n        \n        \n        <section class=\"original-post\" aria-label=\"المنشور الكامل على تيك توك\">\n          <h2>المنشور الكامل</h2>\n          <div class=\"embed-card\" data-embed=\"tiktok\" data-player=\"https://www.tiktok.com/player/v1/7641275591798295828?autoplay=0&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0\" data-title=\"هنقضيها بديهيات على تيك توك\">\n      <button class=\"button outline embed-button\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M16.45 2c.28 2.52 1.68 4.02 4.12 4.18v3.06a7.87 7.87 0 0 1-4.1-1.19v6.53c0 3.47-2.44 5.72-5.44 5.72a5.38 5.38 0 1 1 .73-10.71v3.12a2.52 2.52 0 0 0-.79-.13 2.31 2.31 0 1 0 2.36 2.29V2h3.12Z\"></path></svg> عرض المنشور من تيك توك</button>\n      <div class=\"embed-target\"></div>\n      <p role=\"status\" class=\"embed-status\"></p>\n      <a class=\"source-link\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@withoutpermissionmag/photo/7641275591798295828\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">افتح المنشور على تيك توك <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (هنقضيها بديهيات، يفتح في تبويب جديد)</span></a>\n    </div>\n        </section>","format":"legacy_html"},"en":{"title":"Let’s stick to the basics","description":"Harassment happens beyond the street and social media.","seoTitle":"هنقضيها بديهيات | Without Permission","seoDescription":"Harassment happens beyond the street and social media.","body":"<section class=\"post-reading\"><h2>From the TikTok slides</h2><p dir=\"auto\">Harassment happens beyond the street and social media.</p><p dir=\"auto\">If your brother or father touches you in a way you don’t want, the post calls that harassment. If you’re acting and the actor opposite you crosses the agreed boundaries of the scene, that can also be harassment.</p><p dir=\"auto\">Harassment can happen on Tinder, Bumble, or any dating app.</p></section>\n        \n        \n        <section class=\"original-post\" aria-label=\"Full original post on TikTok\">\n          <h2>Full Post</h2>\n          <div class=\"embed-card\" data-embed=\"tiktok\" data-player=\"https://www.tiktok.com/player/v1/7641275591798295828?autoplay=0&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0\" data-title=\"Let’s stick to the basics on TikTok\">\n      <button class=\"button outline embed-button\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M16.45 2c.28 2.52 1.68 4.02 4.12 4.18v3.06a7.87 7.87 0 0 1-4.1-1.19v6.53c0 3.47-2.44 5.72-5.44 5.72a5.38 5.38 0 1 1 .73-10.71v3.12a2.52 2.52 0 0 0-.79-.13 2.31 2.31 0 1 0 2.36 2.29V2h3.12Z\"></path></svg> Show post from TikTok</button>\n      <div class=\"embed-target\"></div>\n      <p role=\"status\" class=\"embed-status\"></p>\n      <a class=\"source-link\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@withoutpermissionmag/photo/7641275591798295828\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open post on TikTok <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (Let’s stick to the basics, opens in a new tab)</span></a>\n    </div>\n        </section>","format":"legacy_html"}},"cover":"","coverAlt":"","category":"RAW BY VEE / ARCHIVE","byline":"RAW by Vee","tags":[],"featured":false}'::jso