('archive/7643806667762683156/','{"editions":{"ar":{"title":"follow for more common sense!","description":"التحرش مش سببه كبت جنسي. التحرش مش سببه لبس البنت، ولا إن البنت ماشية لوحدها في الشارع، ولا إن البنت مش محجبة.","seoTitle":"follow for more common sense! | من غير إذن","seoDescription":"التحرش مش سببه كبت جنسي. التحرش مش سببه لبس البنت، ولا إن البنت ماشية لوحدها في الشارع، ولا إن البنت مش محجبة.","body":"<section class=\"post-reading\"><h2>من نص السلايدز</h2><p dir=\"auto\">التحرش مش سببه كبت جنسي. التحرش مش سببه لبس البنت، ولا إن البنت ماشية لوحدها في الشارع، ولا إن البنت مش محجبة.</p><p dir=\"auto\">لو لسه بتدور على أي سبب تبرر بيه فعل شنيع زي التحرش، يبقى غالبًا أنت نفسك سبب التحرش.</p></section>\n        \n        \n        <section class=\"original-post\" aria-label=\"المنشور الكامل على تيك توك\">\n          <h2>المنشور الكامل</h2>\n          <div class=\"embed-card\" data-embed=\"tiktok\" data-player=\"https://www.tiktok.com/player/v1/7643806667762683156?autoplay=0&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0\" data-title=\"follow for more common sense! على تيك توك\">\n      <button class=\"button outline embed-button\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M16.45 2c.28 2.52 1.68 4.02 4.12 4.18v3.06a7.87 7.87 0 0 1-4.1-1.19v6.53c0 3.47-2.44 5.72-5.44 5.72a5.38 5.38 0 1 1 .73-10.71v3.12a2.52 2.52 0 0 0-.79-.13 2.31 2.31 0 1 0 2.36 2.29V2h3.12Z\"></path></svg> عرض المنشور من تيك توك</button>\n      <div class=\"embed-target\"></div>\n      <p role=\"status\" class=\"embed-status\"></p>\n      <a class=\"source-link\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@withoutpermissionmag/photo/7643806667762683156\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">افتح المنشور على تيك توك <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (follow for more common sense!، يفتح في تبويب جديد)</span></a>\n    </div>\n        </section>","format":"legacy_html"},"en":{"title":"follow for more common sense!","description":"Harassment isn’t caused by sexual repression, a girl’s clothes, her walking down the street alone, or her going without a hijab.","seoTitle":"follow for more common sense! | Without Permission","seoDescription":"Harassment isn’t caused by sexual repression, a girl’s clothes, her walking down the street alone, or her going without a hijab.","body":"<section class=\"post-reading\"><h2>From the TikTok slides</h2><p dir=\"auto\">Harassment isn’t caused by sexual repression, a girl’s clothes, her walking down the street alone, or her going without a hijab.</p><p dir=\"auto\">If you’re still looking for a reason to excuse something as awful as harassment, you may be part of the problem.</p></section>\n        \n        \n        <section class=\"original-post\" aria-label=\"Full original post on TikTok\">\n          <h2>Full Post</h2>\n          <div class=\"embed-card\" data-embed=\"tiktok\" data-player=\"https://www.tiktok.com/player/v1/7643806667762683156?autoplay=0&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0\" data-title=\"follow for more common sense! on TikTok\">\n      <button class=\"button outline embed-button\" type=\"button\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"23\" height=\"23\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M16.45 2c.28 2.52 1.68 4.02 4.12 4.18v3.06a7.87 7.87 0 0 1-4.1-1.19v6.53c0 3.47-2.44 5.72-5.44 5.72a5.38 5.38 0 1 1 .73-10.71v3.12a2.52 2.52 0 0 0-.79-.13 2.31 2.31 0 1 0 2.36 2.29V2h3.12Z\"></path></svg> Show post from TikTok</button>\n      <div class=\"embed-target\"></div>\n      <p role=\"status\" class=\"embed-status\"></p>\n      <a class=\"source-link\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@withoutpermissionmag/photo/7643806667762683156\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open post on TikTok <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (follow for more